m so glad  that i did  even with the vaults i had i can't  completely understand why the movie went  the way that it did it's just my  personal preference that we would have  stuck with when we was the major threat  rather than pushing in this hypnotic  dragon but you know they they need to  sell toys and a big action spectacle for  the third act that being said i really  hope that this gets the attention it  deserves and i know there is probably a  lot riding on this in terms of whether  venom the eternals and no way home gets  delayed so yeah if you haven't seen it  for whatever reason then go and watch it  and make up your own mind as i know  there's people out there who hated it  and also some that think it's in the top  five marvel movies ever i'm not sure  exactly where i rank it however i will  be going back to watch it again and now  i have my issues i did have fun overall  there are some minor criticisms here and  there but the good far outweighs the bad  and because of this chongqi gets an 8  out of 10.  now obviously let me know your thoughts  on the film below and as a thank you for  dropping a comment you'll be entered  into a prize through on the 30th of  september in which we're giving away  three copies of zack snyder's dc trilogy  the winners of the last month are on  screen right now and if you want a  chance for this one then just leave a  like drop a comment and make sure you  subscribe to the channel with  notifications on if you want something  else to watch then make sure you check  out our breakdown of the perfect scene  in x-men first class which will be  linked on screen right now i think the  movie is absolutely incredible and i  love talking about the coin scene in it  so definitely go check it out right  after this without the way thank you for  singing through the video i've been paul  i'll see you next time take care peace
 

